arry the full EX/MEM or MEM/WB payload.\"\n  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n    description: \"Refactor the memory stage around the narrow request/response records, keeping dmem-ready hold behavior, load forwarding, byte masks, and RVFI data exact while isolating load formatting from retirement metadata.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the compact memory island and parallel retirement sideband through the existing pipeline without changing the top-level buses, single-channel RVFI ports, or retirement boundary.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Update memory-operation hold and load-use controls to follow the compact request acceptance/completion signals without introducing global queue backpressure or duplicate side effects.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
