enting duplicate EX2 redirects.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Adjust redirect, flush, and bubble arbitration so an early-resolved control instruction is captured into EX1 while younger fetch/decode state is flushed, with dmem backpressure taking priority.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the early control-flow redirect and its valid/hold qualification through the existing single-issue pipeline without changing the top-level IO or RVFI contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
