 \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 270.21, \"delta_pct\": -4.46, \"vs_baseline\": -4.46, \"fmax_mhz\": 127.15, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4705548, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10041, \"ff\": 1992, \"seeds\": [111.48, 127.15, 130.17], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T20:09:20.220798Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 1}\ncores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl:4:{\"id\": \"hyp-20260710-003-r1s2\", \"title\": \"Early static backward-branch prediction\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"The bench core resolves conditional branches and jumps in EX, then flushes\\nyounger work and redirects the fetch PC. CoreMark contains many tight loops,\\nso taken backward branches repeatedly pay this avoidable redirect penalty.\\nThe fixture is already close to its LUT budget, making a table-based BTB/BHT\\na riskier tradeoff than a small decode-only predictor.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The bench core resolves conditional branches and jumps in EX, then flushes\\nyounger work and redirects the fetch PC. CoreMark contains many tight loops,\\nso taken backward branches repeatedly pay this avoidable redirect penalty.\\nThe fixture is already close to its LUT budget, making a table-based BTB/BHT\\na riskier tradeoff than a small decode-only predictor.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add an IF-stage static control-flow predictor that predicts valid backward\\nconditional branches taken and predicts direct JAL instructions to their\\nimmediately computed targets; leave forward branches and JALR unpredicted.\\nCarry the predicted next PC through ID/EX and make EX redirect only when the\\nresolved next PC differs from the prediction, recovering to the actual\\ntarget or fall-through PC on a miss. This should remove most EX redirect\\nbubbles from CoreMark loop branches with little area and timing overhead.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute aligned B/J immediates from the fetched instruction and select a predicted target for backward conditional branches and direct JALs before the EX redirect path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the IF/ID and ID/EX pipeline bundles with prediction-valid/target metadata needed to compare the prediction against the resolved next PC.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch the IF-stage prediction metadata alongside the decoded instruction so EX can validate or recover from the prediction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare the resolved branch/jump next PC with the carried prediction and issue redirects only on mispredictions, preserving trap and RVFI pc_next semantics.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute aligned B/J immediates from the fetched instruction and select a predicted target for backward conditional branches and direct JALs before the EX redirect path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Extend the IF/ID and ID/EX pipeline bundles with prediction-valid/target metadata needed to compare the prediction against the resolved next PC.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch the IF-stage prediction metadata alongside the decoded instruction so EX can validate or recover from the prediction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare the resolved branch/jump next PC with the carried prediction and issue redirects only on mispredictions, preserving trap and RVFI pc_next semantics.\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 310.56, \"delta_pct\": 9.81, \"vs_baseline\": 9.81, \"fmax_mhz\": 132.29, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4259699, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10554, \"ff\": 1897, \"seeds\": [128.47, 132.29, 133.98], \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-10T20:04:27.584939Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 1, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-07-10 hyp-20260710-003-r1s2 (improvement, +9.81%): A small IF-stage predictor for backward conditional branches and direct JALs, with prediction metadata carried through ID/EX and EX redirects only on next-PC mismatch, removes most CoreMark loop redirect bubbles without the area cost of a BTB/BHT.\"}\ncores/bench/rtl/mem_stage.sv:17://                 mem_wdata, plus rd_wdata via the loaded-data path.\ncores/bench/rtl/ex_stage.sv:13:// RVFI fields:    feeds pc_wdata (= pc_next), the rd_wdata path for\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv:32:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MUL    = 5'd11;\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv:33:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MULH   = 5'd12;\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv:34:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MULHU  = 5'd13;\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv:35:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_MULHSU = 5'd14;\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv:36:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_DIV    = 5'd15;\ncores/bench/rtl/core_pkg.sv:37:  localparam logic [4:0] ALU_DIVU   = 5'd16;\ncores/bench/rtl/imm_gen.sv:8:// RVFI fields:    feeds the EX-stage immediate path (rd_wdata for ADDI,\ncores/bench/rtl/wb_stage.sv:4:// loaded-data path (mem_to_reg=1) and the ALU-result path. Drives the\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv:89:            10'b0000001_000: alu_op = ALU_MUL;\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv:90:            10'b0000001_001: alu_op = ALU_MULH;\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv:91:            10'b0000001_010: alu_op = ALU_MULHSU;\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv:92:            10'b0000001_011: alu_op = ALU_MULHU;\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv:93:            10'b0000001_100: alu_op = ALU_DIV;\ncores/bench/rtl/decoder.sv:94:            10'b0000001_101: alu_op = ALU_DIVU;\ncores/bench/core.yaml:9:  fmax_mhz: 135\ncores/bench/core.yaml:14:  fmax_mhz: 132.29\ncores/bench/rtl/alu.sv:3:// RV32IM combinational ALU. Hardware