\"Adjust stall and flush arbitration so load-dependent control transfers wait for a valid bypassed operand and wrong-path instructions are killed exactly once.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use the carried resolved-next-PC metadata to suppress duplicate EX redirects while preserving EX misalignment trapping and RVFI pc_wdata correctness.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
