oss.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace the single PC/IF-ID coupling with a small redirect-aware two-entry\\ninstruction prefetch FIFO. Fetch into the FIFO whenever imemReady is high,\\nconsume one entry per cycle into ID, and invalidate both entries on an EX\\nredirect while restarting the fetch pointer at the resolved target. This\\nshould absorb isolated imem stalls and remove front-end bubbles without\\nchanging retirement order or the external bus contract.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement a two-entry instruction prefetch FIFO with fetch and consume pointers, ready-aware capture, and redirect flushing/restart.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Reconnect the fetch-buffer output to the existing ID stage and preserve the current redirect, stall, and RVFI ordering behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Adjust front-end stall/flush arbitration so an imem stall stops FIFO filling but does not discard already buffered instructions.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement a two-entry instruction prefetch FIFO with fetch and consume pointers, ready-aware capture, and redirect flushing/restart.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Reconnect the fetch-buffer output to the existing ID stage and preserve the current redirect, stall, and RVFI ordering behavior.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Adjust front-end stall/flush arbitration so an imem stall stops FIFO filling but does not discard already buffered instructions.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 270.21, \"delta_pct\": -4.46, \"vs_baseline\": -4.46, \"fmax_mhz\": 127.15, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4705548, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 10041, \"ff\": 1992, \"seeds\": [111.48, 