 predictor update event with the resolved branch PC and taken outcome, suppressed while EX is held by a data-memory stall.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the EX branch update event into IF without changing the external buses, pipeline retirement boundary, or single-channel RVFI contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
