: \\\\\\\"The current 5-stage core incurs a 1-cycle... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n6: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778744852031,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e25747e3e00127I2toO2J5nGG0\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"6ef4ad46810c40172e11a19e9d966c945fe33d2d\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2574516b00279gwKJI6qNpLSh\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":40912,\\\"input\\\":2358,\\\"output\\\":74,\\\"reasoning\\\":80,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":38400}},\\\"cost\\\":0.0090001}}\\n7: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778744859247,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e25749a6c001hetQomHEYGtlSQ\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e25747e62001WCYZuYqOyEAmFP\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"6ef4ad46810c40172e11a19e9d966c945fe33d2d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n8: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778744860674,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"read:2\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/kimi-k2_6-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\\\",\\\"limit\\\":20,\\\"offset\\\":21},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/kimi-k2_6-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n21: {\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"hyp-20260514-002-r7s1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Replace combinational divider with iterative multi-cycle unit\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"structural\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motivation\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Th