\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\n27:             \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Must be under rtl/ (any extension) or be a test/test_*.py cocotb suite. Anything else is rejected by the runtime sandbox check.\\\\\\\",\\\\n28:             \\\\\\\"pattern\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"^(rtl/[^.].*|test/test_[^/]+\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n51: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778745435457,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e257d6540001ymxZonqGXNtJIy\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"6ef4ad46810c40172e11a19e9d966c945fe33d2d\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e257c6ac2001Uq1tzuVfRcM3Xb\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":86834,\\\"input\\\":564,\\\"output\\\":0,\\\"reasoning\\\":2450,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":83968}},\\\"cost\\\":0.02377068}}\\n52: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778745441691,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e257d7d9800107mk1M0Z5b3mf0\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e257d6564001xlHwSNB3D2hkNE\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"6ef4ad46810c40172e11a19e9d966c945fe33d2d\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n53: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778745610995,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"write:17\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"id: hyp-20260514-003-r11s2\\\\ntitle: Add 8-entry loop predictor for backward branch exits\\\\ncategory: predictor\\\\nmotivation: |\\\\n  The 32-entry 2-bit BHT already captures forward branch directions and\\\\n  backward-taken bias, but it cannot avoid mispredicting the final iteration\\\\n  of every loop (predicted taken, actually not-taken). CoreMark contains\\\\n  many small inner loops (list traversal, matrix rows, CRC updates) where\\\\n  this exit misprediction wastes cycles. A dedicated loop predictor learns\\\\n  the trip count of individual backward branches and predicts not-taken on\\\\n  the last iteration, removing the only remaining systematic direction\\\\n  mispredictions with only ~100 flops and no wider BHT mux.\\\\nhypothesis: |\\\\n  Add an 8-entry direct-mapped loop predictor table to the IF stage.\\\\n  Each entry stores a tag, a trained iteration length, a speculative\\\\n  down-counter, and a 1-bit confidence flag.\\\\n  When a backward branch is fetched, if the entry is valid, tag matches,\\\\n  and confidence is high, the predictor overrides the BHT:\\\\n    - down-counter > 0  → predict taken and decrement the counter.\\\\n    - down-counter == 0 → predict not-taken.\\\\n  In EX, resolved backward branches update the table:\\\\n    - During training (confidence low) the table counts taken outcomes;\\\\n      the first not-taken exit stores the count as the trained length\\\\n      and sets confidence high.\\\\n    - On a correct exit (predicted not-taken) the counter is reloaded\\\\n      from the trained length for the next loop invocation.\\\\n    - On a length mismatch (mispredict) confidence is cleared so the\\\\n      entry re-trains on the next invocation.\\\\n  This attacks the last predictable bubble source without touching the\\\\n  existing BHT or pipeline bundles.\\\\nexpected_impact:\\\\n  fitness_delta_pct: 3\\\\n  confidence... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n54: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778745614078,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1da8c0d24ffeyR5lnSLdShWPv7\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e25801efe001H7LAYsEFYg6w4B\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"6ef4ad46810c40172e11a19e9d966c945fe33d2d\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e257d6564001xlHwSNB3D2hkNE\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"s