d backward branches.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the EX branch-outcome update into IF so the small global counter updates synchronously without changing the external IO, pipeline retirement boundary, or RVFI contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
