ch.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Expose a precise conditional-branch predictor update event and outcome at EX resolution without changing redirect or RVFI retirement behavior.\"\n1:id: hyp-20260710-003-r2s2\n3:category: predictor\n24:  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n26:  - file: rtl/core.sv\n28:  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
