 loop-predictor update event without changing redirect or RVFI behavior.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the EX loop-branch update event into IF and preserve prediction metadata, bus-stall handling, and the existing single-channel RVFI contract.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
